  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Clay fraction texture describes the particle-size distribution and properties of the clay fraction within the soil. It influences water retention, aeration, and soil plasticity. Source: Hillel, D. (2004). Introduction to Environmental Soil Physics."
  } ],
