  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Coarse fragments are soil particles larger than 2 mm in diameter, such as gravel, cobbles, and stones. They affect soil porosity, water infiltration, and root penetration. Source: Soil Survey Staff (2014). Keys to Soil Taxonomy."
