  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Total potassium includes all potassium in the soil, whether plant-available, mineral-bound, or part of soil minerals like feldspar and mica. It is not immediately accessible to plants. Source: Sparks, D.L. (2003). Environmental Soil Chemistry."
  } ],
