    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "ISRIC Report 2019/01: Tier 1 and Tier 2 data in the context of the federated Global Soil Information System. Appendix 3"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://w3id.org/glosis/model/layerhorizon/SandFractionTexture",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Sand fraction texture describes the proportion of different sand particle sizes (very fine to coarse) within the soil, influencing soil texture and structure. Source: FAO (2006). Guidelines for Soil Description."
