  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Silt particles are intermediate in size between sand and clay (0.002 to 0.05 mm). Soils high in silt are fertile, smooth, and moderately water-retentive. Source: Soil Science Society of America (SSSA) Glossary."
  } ],
