  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Extractable sodium is the fraction of sodium ions in soil that can be removed by chemical extractants and assessed for salinity or sodicity potential. Source: FAO (2006). Guidelines for Soil Description."
